              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The "
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "text": "Courses",
              "target": { "kind": "external", "ref": "/course" }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " section organizes academic content related to Algorithm Analysis and Design. From the main view, you can review which courses are available and what progress percentage you have in each one."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-m08-s01-img01",
              "type": "image",
              "resourceRef": "img-08-courses-dashboard",
              "display": {
                "width": "full",
                "captionPosition": "bottom"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-m08-s01-p02",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Progress updates as you complete sections. This lets you resume studying without relying on memory or repeating already completed content."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec-recorrer-modulo",
          "slug": "go-through-module",
          "title": "Go through sequential content",
          "order": 2,
          "kind": "practice",
          "trackProgress": true,
          "estimatedMinutes": 12,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "blk-m08-s02-p01",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "When you enter a course, move through its modules in order. Each section presents content, examples, or explanations designed to prepare the student before evaluated practice."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-m08-s02-img01",
              "type": "image",
              "resourceRef": "img-08-course-module-content",
              "display": {
                "width": "full",
                "captionPosition": "bottom"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-m08-s02-p02",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "When a section is completed, the system lets you continue to the next topic. The structure prevents learning from being reduced to answering quizzes without reviewing the conceptual base."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec-desbloqueo-quiz",
          "slug": "quiz-unlock",
          "title": "Unlock quizzes through progress",
          "order": 3,
          "kind": "practice",
          "trackProgress": true,
          "estimatedMinutes": 10,
